    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4340-287X"
abstract: >
  AutoTAB is an automated algorithm to track bipolar magnetic regions over their lifetime
  using MDI and HMI magnetograms from 1996 to 2020. It enables studies of BMR evolution,
  tilt angle, flux, and statistical properties across solar cycles.
keywords:
  - solar magnetism
  - bipolar magnetic regions
  - automatic tracking
  - surface flux transport
